                          <h4>STAFF INDUCTION DOCUMENT</h4>
                          <p>I, <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" class="width30">, acknowledge that I have
                            received guidance and understood staff induction program the provided by <input type="tel"
                              id="phone" name="phone" class="width30">. I understand the policies, procedures, and terms
                            and conditions outlined during induction and agree to abide by them during my employment
